# Pramaan aggregation

Content is aggregated from exactly four platforms:

- Twitter (label the product “Twitter”, not “X”; URLs may still be x.com)
- Substack
- YouTube
- Podcasts

Do not add LinkedIn or any other source. `SourceKind` is `"twitter" | "substack" | "youtube" | "podcast"`.

Events are listed on Pramaan (title, time, host, format). Sign-up, tickets, and attendance always happen on the host’s page (Zoom, YouTube Live, Twitter, Substack, Google Meet, in-person). Never imply Pramaan collects registrations.

This is a discovery index, not a CMS. Creators do not publish on Pramaan. Indexed pieces are outbound links only — show unfurl-scale preview (title or ≤100 characters of body, source, creator). Never host or display full post content on Pramaan.
